    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.tabline\n\n### Description\n\nFollowing #152,\r\n\r\nAt the moment, `mini.tabline` doesn't support colored icons. It's good to have an option for that, such as `{colored_devicons = true}` by default. \r\n\r\nSince it's only for customization, not really important, so please consider this feature when you got free time. \r\n\r\nMany thanks!",
