            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Apologies for the necro; I saw in Neovim 0.12, there was a pertinent addition:\n\n> $ - Same as #, except the `%$HLname$` group will inherit from preceding highlight attributes.\n\nWould that make this more feasible to implement? \n\n(There could still be edge cases where a user has set a background for one of these icons explicitly, though I'm not sure how likely that is.)",
